namespace x
individuals user, message
primitive system

[A]
When a user sends a message, the system shall either store the message or reject the message.

scenario EACH-ITS-OWN:
    given a user U1, a message M1, a message M2
    at 0 ms: U1 sends M1.
    at 0 ms: U1 sends M2.
    at 1 seconds: the system stores M1.
    at 1 seconds: the system rejects M2.
    expect allowed

scenario ONE-LEFT-OUT:
    given a user U1, a message M1, a message M2
    at 0 ms: U1 sends M1.
    at 0 ms: U1 sends M2.
    at 1 seconds: the system stores M1.
    at 1 seconds: the system rejects M1.
    expect forbidden
